--TEST--
A `#[Json\Derive]` or `#[Db\Derive]` class with no written constructor is one `E0460` at the attribute, even when every property has a default, because a decode is an ordinary `new`
--FILE--
<?nvs
#[Core\Json\Derive]
class Point {
    public int $x = 1;
    public int $y = 2;
}

#[Core\Db\Derive]
class Row {
    public int $id = 0;
}

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0460]: `Point` has `#[Json\Derive]` but no `constructor`
  --> case.nvs:2:3
%A
error[E0460]: `Row` has `#[Db\Derive]` but no `constructor`
  --> case.nvs:8:3
%A
error: aborting due to 2 errors
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
